<title>UK: Council of Europe sets 3.0 bln FFR 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets 3.0 bln FFR 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers JP Morgan and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE SOCIAL DEVELOPMENT FUND</p>
<p> AMT ***3.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    06.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  **	  REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	    ***CLAUSE TO REDENOMINATE INTO EUROS POST-EMU</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED APRIL 2007 AND OCTOBER 2007 OATS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
